WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Ron · Analog Intelligence · NASA Space Apps 2026

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Planning Moon field tests? Start with the terrain.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Compare NASA LOLA Moon terrain with ESA Copernicus Earth data.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Morocco passes our shape cut-off. The closest listed site does not.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Steep-end slopes are close. Larger-scale bumpiness still differs.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Villages and trees may affect the data. Not a ready test site.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Two tests failed; one could not decide. All results are published.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.900
A starting point for investigation, with evidence and limits.
